<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<!-- profile-styled.html -->
<style>
html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333333;
    background-color: #fff8dc;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
}

header {
    text-align: center;
}

#title {
    color: #003366;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.section {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 20px;
    margin: 15px 0;
    border: 2px solid #003366;
    border-radius: 10px;
}

.section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: #003366;
}

b, strong {
    color: #003366;
}

.section mark {
    background-color: #fff8dc;
    color: #333333;
    padding: 2px 6px;
}

label {
    display: block;
    margin: 4px 0;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px 0 20px;
}

a {
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
}

a:link { color: blue; }
a:visited { color: purple; }
a:hover { color: red; }
a:active { color: orange; }

button {
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
    cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover { background-color: lightblue; }
button:focus { outline: 2px solid blue; }
button:disabled { background-color: lightgray; cursor: not-allowed; }

input:checked { accent-color: green; }
input:required { outline: 2px solid orange; }
input:valid { accent-color: green; }
input:invalid { accent-color: red; }

section:target {
    background-color: lightyellow;
    border: 2px solid orange;
}

.section > p:first-of-type::first-line {
    color: blue;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* drop cap only on the introduction */
#intro p::first-letter {
    font-size: 30px;
    color: red;
}

::selection {
    background-color: yellow;
    color: black;
}

a[download] { color: green; }
a[download]:hover { color: darkgreen; }

input[type="radio"] { cursor: pointer; }

/* external links */
a[href^="https"] { background-color: lightyellow; }

/* PDF links */
a[href$=".pdf"] { font-weight: bold; }

/* YouTube links get YouTube's red */
a[href*="youtube"] { color: red; }
a[href*="youtube"]:hover { color: darkred; }
</style>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Ivan James S. Sargado - Personal Profile</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body id="top">

    <header>
        <h1 id="title">Ivan James S. Sargado</h1>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#intro">About Me</a>
        <a href="#hobbies">Hobbies</a>
        <a href="#interests">Interests</a>
        <a href="#funfact">Fun Fact</a>
        <a href="#contact">Say Hi</a>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/">Youtube</a>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <section class="section" id="intro">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>Hi my name is <b>Ivan</b>, I'm a first year <strong>BS Computer Science</strong> student.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="hobbies">
            <h2>Hobbies</h2>
            <p>I love to play <em>online games</em> and watch videos on tiktok. I like to explore the <i>Earth's past</i> and know the different species lived in the past.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="interests">
            <h2>Interests</h2>
            <p>I enjoy eating and tasting different kinds of food. I want to learn about <mark>coding</mark> and also to play a <mark>stringed instrument</mark>.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="funfact">
            <h2>Fun Fact</h2>
            <p>Fun fact about me is that I sometimes look like I'm not the kind of person you enjoy to be with, but once you get to know me, you'll know how I'm easy to get along with.</p>
            <p>Want to see what I watch? <a href="https://www.youtube.com/">Youtube</a></p>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="contact">
            <h2>Say Hi</h2>
            <form>
                <p>What would you like to talk about?</p>
                <label><input type="radio" name="topic" required> Online games</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="topic"> Coding</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="topic"> Food</label>
                <label><input type="radio" name="topic"> Earth's past</label>
                <p>
                    <button type="submit">Start a Chat!</button>
                    <button type="button" disabled>Resume Coming Soon</button>
                </p>
            </form>
            <p><a href="ivan-profile.pdf" download>Download My Profile Sheet</a></p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <a href="#top">Back to top</a>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
